  "ruleText": "Lab 502.01 \"Benefits\" mean disability compensation under RSA 281-A:23 II, RSA 281-A:23-b, RSA 281-A:25- a ,RSA 281-A:26, RSA 281-A:28, RSA 281-A:29, RSA 281-A:31, RSA 281-A:32, RSA 281-A:33, and RSA 281-A:37 and medical or rehabilitation costs under RSA 281-A:23, and RSA 281-A:25 respectively.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Lab 502) #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97\n\nNew. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6806, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
